{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Come, sit. Vitals I have taken only. BP is 128 over 82, pulse 78, oxygen 98 percent.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Uh one second, this screen is hanging. Sorry, the BP again?",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (NURSE): 128 over 82. Pulse 78.",
  "[SEG0004] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Sorry doctor, the auto was stuck near the signal, we got a bit late.",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (DOCTOR): It's fine. What is the problem?",
  "[SEG0006] person_4 (PATIENT): Back.",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Lower back is paining since three weeks. The pain is shooting down the left leg.",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (DOCTOR): Sorry, say again? I was typing.",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Three weeks. Lower back, going into the left leg. Sitting makes it worse.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any numbness?",
  "[SEG0011] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Bowel or urine problem?",
  "[SEG0013] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0014] person_3 (CAREGIVER): He takes ibuprofin, 400 milligrams, morning and night, for the pain.",
  "[SEG0015] person_2 (DOCTOR): Which tablet? Umm, the dose once more, I didn't catch it.",
  "[SEG0016] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Ibuprofen 400 mg, twice a day. His colleague at the office told him to do some stretches, so he has been trying those only.",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (DOCTOR): Mm. Any test before this?",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Last year, err, a sugar test. They said it was borderline.",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (DOCTOR): Borderline, hmm, no actual figure with it. Any medicine allergy?",
  "[SEG0020] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (DOCTOR): Kindly lie down. Straight leg raise on the left is positive, about 40 degrees. Right side is fine.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (CAREGIVER): See, he pulled back on the left.",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (DOCTOR): Yes. I think it is nerve irritation from the lower back. Provisional, mind you.",
  "[SEG0024] person_4 (PATIENT): Mm.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (DOCTOR): No scan just now. We might do a scan if it does not settle. Physio I am booking for Monday morning.",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Monday he can come.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (DOCTOR): The nurse takes bloods Thursday morning, ESR and CRP. Fasting from midnight. Ibuprofen he can continue, no need to stop.",
  "[SEG0028] person_1 (NURSE): Thursday 8 am, fasting, I will book it.",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (DOCTOR): If those are borderline we do the third test, the HLA-B27. Only then.",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Not today, then.",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (DOCTOR): Correct. I'll see you in two weeks.",
  "[SEG0032] person_4 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (CAREGIVER): And the sitting at office, should he reduce it?",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (DOCTOR): Yes, kindly stand up every half hour. Don't sit continuously."
 ],
